  <ferc:MannerAndExtentOfCorporateControl id="f-33" contextRef="c-1">Gillis Hub Pipeline, LLC is a limited liability company formed on February 10, 2023 in the state of Delaware. It is a wholly-owned subsidiary of SWLA Pipeline Holdings, LLC, which is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Sempra LNG Holding, LP, which is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Sempra Global Holdings, LP, which is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Sempra Infrastructure Partners, LP.</ferc:MannerAndExtentOfCorporateControl>
