        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:107%">Gillis Hub Pipeline, LLC (GHP) is charged by Sempra Infrastructure Partners, LP for services such as human resources, treasury, legal, tax, property and liability insurance, other administrative functions, and for other costs incurred on its behalf. These costs are based on direct assignment to the extent practicable, or by using allocations determined by Sempra Infrastructure Partners, LP based on the utilization of services provided to or for the benefits received by GHP.</span>
